      "facts": [
        "Whether Postgres keeps a mirror of the Convex `daytona_migration` sidecar (each project's Daytona server and sandbox migration state; Postgres table of the same name). COD-742 sandboxes; runbook in docs/freebuff-sandbox-errors-postgres.md, \"Migration sidecar\".",
        "Cloud connect, the snapshot migration) have not moved.",
        "There is no `postgres` yet: that comes with the writers' port.",
        "Imported by the jobs worker and the Next servers, so it must stay a leaf. A flip is a reviewed one-line diff here, never an env var.",
        "Whether the projection mirrors Convex into Postgres."
      ],
