        "title": "Sandbox migration backend flag added to common constants",
        "summary": "Added `SandboxMigrationBackend` type and `SANDBOX_MIGRATION_BACKEND` constant in `common/src/constants/` to control whether the Postgres projection mirrors the Convex `daytona_migration` sidecar. The new `sandboxMigrationMirrored` helper returns true only when the backend is set to `shadow`, enabling the read path to verify Postgres mirror consistency while Convex remains the writer. This establishes the initial control surface for the sandbox migration projection chain, currently defaulting to `convex` so no Postgres mirroring occurs.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "audience": "maintainers",
        "evidence": "New file `common/src/constants/sandbox-migration-backend.ts` introduces type `SandboxMigrationBackend`, constant `SANDBOX_MIGRATION_BACKEND` set to `'convex'`, and function `sandboxMigrationMirrored` that returns true only when the backend is `'shadow'`.",
